<section class="single-herbs-guide__section" aria-labelledby="topic-twentyfour-foundations"><h4 id="topic-twentyfour-foundations"><?php echo s($bloodtonifytext('Herbs that tonify Blood: general introduction','Hierbas que tonifican Sangre: introducción general'));?></h4><p class="single-herbs-guide__section-lead"><?php echo s($bloodtonifytext('The four herbs are not interchangeable. Ask whether the patient needs deep Essence, active Blood movement, bleeding control/Lung moisture, or Liver softening and containment.','Las cuatro no son intercambiables. Pregunta si necesita Esencia profunda, movimiento activo de Sangre, control de sangrado/humedad de Pulmón o suavizar y contener Hígado.'));?></p><div class="single-herbs-guide__decision"><div><strong><?php echo s($bloodtonifytext('Deepest / strongest','Más profunda / fuerte'));?></strong><span>Shu Di Huang</span></div><div><strong><?php echo s($bloodtonifytext('Nourish + move','Nutrir + mover'));?></strong><span>Dang Gui</span></div><div><strong><?php echo s($bloodtonifytext('Bleeding + dryness','Sangrado + sequedad'));?></strong><span>E Jiao</span></div><div><strong><?php echo s($bloodtonifytext('Soften + contain','Suavizar + contener'));?></strong><span>Bai Shao</span></div></div><aside class="single-herbs-guide__memory-path"><p class="single-herbs-guide__memory-line"><?php echo s($bloodtonifytext('Enter the Blood garden.','Entra al jardín de la Sangre.'));?></p><p><?php echo s($bloodtonifytext('Shu Di Huang fills the black underground reservoir. Dang Gui sends a warm river through the beds. E Jiao repairs a leaking bridge and moistens the dry greenhouse. Bai Shao ties a cool white ribbon around the tense Liver tree so it can bend without breaking.','Shu Di Huang llena el depósito negro subterráneo. Dang Gui envía un río tibio por los canteros. E Jiao repara un puente con fuga y humedece el invernadero seco. Bai Shao ata una cinta blanca fresca al árbol tenso del Hígado para que se doble sin romperse.'));?></p></aside><p class="single-herbs-guide__safety"><strong><?php echo s($bloodtonifytext('Digestive boundary:','Límite digestivo:'));?></strong> <?php echo s($bloodtonifytext('Shu Di Huang and E Jiao are especially cloying. If deficiency coexists with Dampness, Phlegm, food stagnation or weak digestion, the obstruction and the Middle Jiao must be addressed.','Shu Di Huang y E Jiao son especialmente empalagosas. Si la deficiencia coexiste con Humedad, Flema, alimento estancado o digestión débil, debe tratarse la obstrucción y el Jiao Medio.'));?></p><ol class="single-herbs-guide__category-herbs"><?php foreach($bloodtonifyherbs as $h):?><li class="single-herbs-guide__category-herb single-herbs-guide__category-herb--core"><div class="single-herbs-guide__category-herb-head"><strong><?php echo s($h['name']);?></strong><em><?php echo s($h['latin']);?></em><span class="single-herbs-guide__category-herb-badge"><?php echo s($bloodtonifytext('Current category list','Lista vigente de la categoría'));?></span></div><p><?php echo s($h['identity']);?></p></li><?php endforeach;?></ol></section>

